          "thread": "DefiLlama volume legitimacy",
          "why": "A data aggregator publicly questioning and then quietly restoring Aster's listing — with history missing — hit the rawest nerve in DeFi: whether reported volumes are real, making this a proxy battle over the entire DEX credibility stack."
